---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Terms & Conditions — Image to Base64 | ImageToBase64.dpdns.org"
	description="Read the Terms and Conditions for using ImageToBase64.dpdns.org."
	canonical="https://www.imagetobase64.dpdns.org/terms"
>
	<main style="max-width:800px; margin:0 auto; padding:64px 24px 96px; font-family:'Geist',Arial,sans-serif; color:var(--text-body); line-height:1.75;">
		<h1 style="font-size:36px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); letter-spacing:-1px; margin:0 0 8px;">
			Terms &amp; Conditions
		</h1>
		<p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-mute); margin:0 0 32px;">
			Last Updated: September 17, 2026
		</p>

		<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-color); margin-bottom:40px;"></div>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				By accessing and using <strong>ImageToBase64.dpdns.org</strong> ("the Website"), you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Website.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">2. Description of Service</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				ImageToBase64.dpdns.org provides a free, client-side online web utility for encoding image files into Base64 format and decoding Base64 strings into images. The service is provided "as-is" and "as-available" for personal, educational, and commercial development use.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">3. User Responsibilities & Data Security</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				Because all image conversion occurs locally in your browser without transmitting data to our servers, you retain full ownership and responsibility for the images and data you encode or decode. You agree not to use this tool for illegal or unauthorized purposes.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				All custom design elements, branding, code structure, and content on ImageToBase64.dpdns.org are protected by copyright. You may freely copy and use the base64 code output generated by the tool in your own projects.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				In no event shall ImageToBase64.dpdns.org or its operators be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the Website, including data loss or loss of business.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">6. Contact Us</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				If you have questions regarding these Terms, please reach out via our <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--accent-blue); text-decoration:none;">Contact Page</a>.
			</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
